#audit_axioms GroupApproximation.SimpleKazhdanSofic.ThmMainB.manuscriptSentence_ringFiniteSumsCovariance
#audit_axioms GroupApproximation.SimpleKazhdanSofic.ThmMainB.manuscriptSentence_finitelyGeneratedSoPropertyT
